{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想讓孩子把數學練習當成遊戲，不妨試試 Math Dash。這款跑酷學習遊戲專為 6 至 8 歲兒童設計，把加減乘除、分數、數數、拼字與邏輯規律融入奔跑跳躍的關卡，原價 US $0.99，現正於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-158.webp\">\n<h2>邊跑邊答的數學練習</h2>\n<p>Math Dash 把加減乘除練習變成橫向跑酷遊戲，適合 6 至 8 歲兒童。玩家可選擇 Pip、Tally、Smudge 或 Rumble 四位角色，奔跑跳躍並抓取寫有正確答案的數字泡泡，答對可為角色充能，答錯只會輕微搖晃。練習涵蓋加減乘除、分數、數數、拼字與邏輯規律，並可指定只練某一組數字。系統會記下答錯的題目，組成溫和的重點練習。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-168-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-169-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-170-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-171-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-172-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-173-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Math Dash: Kid-Friendly Games</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.973151+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T23:59:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:38:05.764029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:13.020931+00:00","content_hash":"66455fa76fcf8b48d07e9e6bbc20fa827285a9d820abd2ae9cf26bd55490562a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}